2.3  Knowledge distillation
Large-scale deep learning models have achieved overwhelming successes in a variety of applications, including computer vision, natural language processing and more. However, the huge computational complexity and massive storage requirements of these models make it a great challenge to deploy them in real-time applications, especially on devices with limited resources such as mobile devices and embedded systems. To enable more efficient deep models, model compression and acceleration techniques have been developed. One of those techniques is Knowledge Distillation (KD) [18] (also sometimes called model distillation), where the knowledge

